ICTC-O2 HP is a private research project. No public distribution or
third-party license grant is implied by this repository.

The Cartesian O(2) mathematics and tensor-product implementation were extracted
from the separately qualified O(2) engineering task dated 2026-10-11.
EquivariantX is an external benchmark comparator and is not included in this
package. Current comparison scripts, recorded results and final figures are
included under benchmarks/eqx but excluded from the installed library package.
Historical experiments, general tests, job logs and compiler caches remain
in a separate private archive.
